            </note>
            <note corresp="#d725-f2" n="94" xml:id="d725-f2-content">
                <p>Arthur J. Pack and John L. Royden, Commercial Counselor and Commercial Secretary,
                    respectively, of the British Embassy in Chile.</p>
            </note>
